{
  "id": "r4_auth_review",
  "route": "R4",
  "description": "Security review of JWT auth implementation",
  "timeout_seconds": 180,
  "workspace_template": "r4_workspace",
  "max_turns": 10,
  "judge_profile": "security_review",
  "judge_rubric": {
    "criteria": [
      "Severity-ranked findings or threats with concrete evidence",
      "Coverage of seeded auth vulnerabilities in the workspace",
      "Remediation specificity and practicality",
      "Structured output quality and internal consistency"
    ],
    "expected_findings": [
      "hardcoded JWT secret",
      "weak bcrypt rounds",
      "user-controlled role escalation",
      "password hash leaked in register response",
      "username enumeration in login errors",
      "missing algorithm pinning in jwt.verify",
      "error detail leakage from auth middleware",
      "unprotected /users endpoint"
    ]
  },
  "variants": [
    {
      "id": "r4_v1",
      "prompt": "Review the JWT authentication implementation in this project for security vulnerabilities.\n\nProvide a structured security review with:\n1. A severity-ranked list of findings (CRITICAL, HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW)\n2. For each finding: description, impact, and specific remediation\n3. At least check for: algorithm confusion attacks, token expiry handling, secret management, injection via claims, missing validation, CSRF concerns\n4. A summary of the overall security posture\n\nFormat your output as JSON: {\"findings\": [{\"severity\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\", \"impact\": \"...\", \"remediation\": \"...\"}], \"summary\": \"...\", \"overall_risk\": \"HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW\"}",
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["findings", "summary", "overall_risk"],
        "properties": {
          "findings": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 2,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["severity", "title", "description", "impact", "remediation"],
              "properties": {
                "severity": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["CRITICAL", "HIGH", "MEDIUM", "LOW"]
                },
                "title": {"type": "string", "minLength": 3},
                "description": {"type": "string", "minLength": 8},
                "impact": {"type": "string", "minLength": 8},
                "remediation": {"type": "string", "minLength": 8}
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "summary": {"type": "string", "minLength": 12},
          "overall_risk": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["HIGH", "MEDIUM", "LOW"]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "acceptance_checks": [
        {"type": "output_json_schema"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_v2",
      "prompt": "Perform a security audit of the authentication and authorization code in this project.\n\nFocus on:\n1. Token lifecycle (creation, validation, refresh, revocation)\n2. Password handling (hashing, storage, comparison)\n3. Session management\n4. Authorization checks (are endpoints properly protected?)\n5. Error handling (does it leak information?)\n\nProvide output as JSON: {\"audit_sections\": [{\"area\": \"...\", \"status\": \"PASS|FAIL|WARN\", \"findings\": [\"...\"], \"recommendations\": [\"...\"]}], \"critical_issues\": [\"...\"], \"overall_grade\": \"A|B|C|D|F\"}",
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["audit_sections", "critical_issues", "overall_grade"],
        "properties": {
          "audit_sections": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 3,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["area", "status", "findings", "recommendations"],
              "properties": {
                "area": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2},
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["PASS", "FAIL", "WARN"]
                },
                "findings": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2}
                },
                "recommendations": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2}
                }
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "critical_issues": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2}
          },
          "overall_grade": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["A", "B", "C", "D", "F"]
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "acceptance_checks": [
        {"type": "output_json_schema"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r4_v3",
      "prompt": "Review this project's auth implementation and create a threat model.\n\nInclude:\n1. Attack surface enumeration (entry points, trust boundaries)\n2. STRIDE analysis for the auth flow\n3. Top 5 threats ranked by risk (likelihood × impact)\n4. Specific mitigations for each threat\n5. Missing security controls\n\nFormat as JSON: {\"attack_surface\": [{\"entry_point\": \"...\", \"trust_boundary\": \"...\"}], \"threats\": [{\"category\": \"STRIDE letter\", \"description\": \"...\", \"risk\": \"HIGH|MEDIUM|LOW\", \"mitigation\": \"...\"}], \"missing_controls\": [\"...\"], \"priority_actions\": [\"...\"]}",
      "output_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": ["attack_surface", "threats", "missing_controls", "priority_actions"],
        "properties": {
          "attack_surface": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 2,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["entry_point", "trust_boundary"],
              "properties": {
                "entry_point": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2},
                "trust_boundary": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2}
              },
              "additionalProperties": true
            }
          },
          "threats": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 4,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "required": ["category", "description", "risk", "mitigation"],
              "properties": {
                "category": {"type": "string", "minLength": 1},
                "description": {"type": "string", "minLength": 8},
                "risk": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": ["HIGH", "MEDIUM", "LOW"]
                },
                "mitigation": {"type": "string", "minLength": 8}
              },
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "missing_controls": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2}
          },
          "priority_actions": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {"type": "string", "minLength": 2}
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false
      },
      "acceptance_checks": [
        {"type": "output_json_schema"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
